SOAPBOX: Great DX conditions on 15/20/40m.
SOAPBOX: 10m was poor and storms wiped out 80/160m.
SOAPBOX: Long Path to North, Central and South America on 20m each morning as well as a few stations LP on 15m. Overall able to work DX continuously for 48 hours and the bands we full of stations, best SSB I have seen for a while from Zone 30.
SOAPBOX: My Station consisted of Icom IC7610, Icom IC2KL 500w PA, SteppIR 3e 10/15/20m beam at 26' and wire dipoles for 40/80/160 at 20'.
